# Protease and gelatine: a protein-cutting enzyme
#
# Equal hydrated gelatine samples compare protease, no enzyme, and lactase.
register lv1

add v1 water 50mL
add v1 gelatin 10g
add v1 protease 0.1g

new beaker
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 gelatin 10g

new beaker
add v3 water 50mL
add v3 gelatin 10g
add v3 lactase 0.1g

wait 1h
look v1
look v2
look v3

# This computes bounded protein hydrolysis. Gel texture and named peptide or
# amino-acid products remain outside the model, so it does not fake a jelly.
